index.json
# Generated batch sidecars (record in-flight providers) and their companion
# JSONL (contains full extracted article text + similar-reading context).
# Never commit: a stray `git add .` would publish corpus contents.
*.batch.json
*.batch.input.jsonl
*.input.jsonl
# The reconcile lock and its rename-and-reclaim artifacts; the lock file
# lives at `<sidecar>.lock`, and reclaim leaves `<sidecar>.lock.broken.*`.
*.batch.json.lock
*.batch.json.lock.broken.*
*.batch.input.jsonl.*.tmp
.*.tmp
# Temp Reddit thread JSON saved by the reddit-import skill (may hold logged-in content)
.reddit-thread.tmp.json
chrome-reading-list.csv
*.log
.DS_Store
